# D2 — FULL exynos subdriver set (opt-in modeset experiments ONLY).
# WARNING: binds display HW. FIMD claims the same DECON/DSIM registers as
# the vendor EXYNOS_DECON_FB driver (double-drive -> black panel risk);
# HDMI/Mixer/FIMC probe for HW absent on j7elte; GSC needs ARCH_EXYNOS5
# (not set) so olddefconfig drops it. Do NOT flash on the shared phone
# without the integrator gate. Ship helper deps explicitly: MFD_SYSCON
# (FIMC), FB_MODE_HELPERS (FIMD), VIDEOMODE_HELPERS (FIMD, "is not set"
# in stock). Expected post-olddefconfig: FIMD/HDMI/VIDI/G2D/IPP/FIMC/
# ROTATOR=y, GSC dropped ("is not set"), FRAMEBUFFER_CONSOLE still off.
CONFIG_MODULES=y
CONFIG_DRM=y
CONFIG_DRM_KMS_HELPER=y
CONFIG_DRM_EXYNOS=y
CONFIG_MFD_SYSCON=y
CONFIG_FB_MODE_HELPERS=y
CONFIG_VIDEOMODE_HELPERS=y
CONFIG_DRM_EXYNOS_FIMD=y
CONFIG_DRM_EXYNOS_HDMI=y
CONFIG_DRM_EXYNOS_G2D=y
CONFIG_DRM_EXYNOS_DMABUF=y
CONFIG_DRM_EXYNOS_VIDI=y
CONFIG_DRM_EXYNOS_IPP=y
CONFIG_DRM_EXYNOS_FIMC=y
CONFIG_DRM_EXYNOS_ROTATOR=y
CONFIG_DRM_EXYNOS_GSC=y
